 "caption": "Airbnb or a long-term tenant? Same house, two very different jobs.\n\nLong-term: a tenant signs a lease and pays about the same rent every month. Simple and steady, but usually less money.\n\nShort-term: guests come and go and usually pay more per night. But busy and slow months swing your income, and you pay for cleaning, furniture and supplies.\n\nMany cities limit short-term rentals, so check your local rules first.\n\nMore money, or less work? That's the trade-off.\n\n#realestateinvesting #realestateexplained #rentalproperty #airbnb #shorttermrental",
